1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,750
Five things you must
never do in Iceland.

2
00:00:03,249 --> 00:00:04,936
Don't skip the naked shower.

3
00:00:04,936 --> 00:00:06,322
Every pool requires it,

4
00:00:06,322 --> 00:00:08,009
with soap, before you enter.

5
00:00:08,513 --> 00:00:10,611
Don't turn your back
on the ocean at

6
00:00:10,611 --> 00:00:12,826
Reynisfjara. Sneaker
waves have killed

7
00:00:12,826 --> 00:00:14,983
visitors, so obey
the warning lights.

8
00:00:15,484 --> 00:00:16,782
Don't drive off-road.

9
00:00:16,782 --> 00:00:18,081
All of it is illegal,

10
00:00:18,081 --> 00:00:20,616
and fines can
reach hundreds of thousands

11
00:00:20,616 --> 00:00:21,234
of krónur.

12
00:00:21,738 --> 00:00:23,855
Don't ignore weather
and road alerts.

13
00:00:23,855 --> 00:00:25,801
A stuck vehicle
is the most common

14
00:00:25,801 --> 00:00:26,488
rescue call.

15
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:28,766
And don't tip
like it's America.

16
00:00:28,766 --> 00:00:29,877
Service is included,

17
00:00:29,877 --> 00:00:31,320
and tips are not expected.
